    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/98aad2ede7e0d5f8c5ec627bc01f94b8.poster.avif?t=1747085888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/98aad2ede7e0d5f8c5ec627bc01f94b8.webm?t=1747085888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/98aad2ede7e0d5f8c5ec627bc01f94b8.mp4?t=1747085888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>One of the Outer House launches a series of attacks against an Inner House on the 3rd of the 714th galactic year. This is not open warfare, but a covert backstabbing attack to be carried out under cover, because of a past family scandal.<br>The League is hired as the &quot;puppet master of fate&quot;. You must sabotage the mines in the hyperspace-bubbles of the targeted house, and the processing facilities outside it, to embarrass them in the eyes of the Emperor. Other agents of the League are also in action elsewhere.<br>Our clan is well suited for this task, as we are the &quot;Worm Dwellers&quot; of the despised mutant caste who can handle the harshness of hyperspace as opposed to the &quot;Softy&quot; ones.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/4c2107e215068adb426fd17f326035f4.poster.avif?t=1747085888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/4c2107e215068adb426fd17f326035f4.webm?t=1747085888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/4c2107e215068adb426fd17f326035f4.mp4?t=1747085888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The mission pays well and we have a close relationship with the League. Their agents activated a virus in the targeted system, which disrupted the drones' functions and their AI will be unable to make comprehensive controls and interpretations. If you are as effective as possible in combat, the Corps will prioritize your ship's upgrades!<br>Your job is to cause chaos in this bubble colony...<br><br>THE HYPERSPACE IS US!<br><br>The goal of this shooting game is to reach the endpoint of the map.<br>Among the tasks, you will have<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Eliminate a given number of enemies and turrets<br></li><li>Cut the enemy supplies by destroying them before they fall down to the ground<br></li><li>Survive for a given time<br></li><li>Support your ally for a given time<br></li><li>Destroy the most important building of the enemy<br></li><li>Fight with the boss's huge airship</li></ul><br>For the whole game, you will shoot hundreds of enemy warplanes, turrets, and parachutes.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 exciting missions<br></li><li>8 kinds of weapons and upgrades (guns, rockets, bombs, air-air, and air-ground weapons)<br></li><li>8 different enemy aircraft and turrets<br></li><li>Various environments on 5 maps<br></li><li>Destructible buildings<br></li><li>Full 3D VR simulation of the flight</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/4bedcb2c1a91ad2e5e4e23c556574514.poster.avif?t=1747085888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/4bedcb2c1a91ad2e5e4e23c556574514.webm?t=1747085888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/4bedcb2c1a91ad2e5e4e23c556574514.mp4?t=1747085888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Good luck soldier!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/98aad2ede7e0d5f8c5ec627bc01f94b8.poster.avif?t=1747085888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/98aad2ede7e0d5f8c5ec627bc01f94b8.webm?t=1747085888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/98aad2ede7e0d5f8c5ec627bc01f94b8.mp4?t=1747085888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>One of the Outer House launches a series of attacks against an Inner House on the 3rd of the 714th galactic year. This is not open warfare, but a covert backstabbing attack to be carried out under cover, because of a past family scandal.<br>The League is hired as the &quot;puppet master of fate&quot;. You must sabotage the mines in the hyperspace-bubbles of the targeted house, and the processing facilities outside it, to embarrass them in the eyes of the Emperor. Other agents of the League are also in action elsewhere.<br>Our clan is well suited for this task, as we are the &quot;Worm Dwellers&quot; of the despised mutant caste who can handle the harshness of hyperspace as opposed to the &quot;Softy&quot; ones.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/4c2107e215068adb426fd17f326035f4.poster.avif?t=1747085888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/4c2107e215068adb426fd17f326035f4.webm?t=1747085888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/4c2107e215068adb426fd17f326035f4.mp4?t=1747085888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The mission pays well and we have a close relationship with the League. Their agents activated a virus in the targeted system, which disrupted the drones' functions and their AI will be unable to make comprehensive controls and interpretations. If you are as effective as possible in combat, the Corps will prioritize your ship's upgrades!<br>Your job is to cause chaos in this bubble colony...<br><br>THE HYPERSPACE IS US!<br><br>The goal of this shooting game is to reach the endpoint of the map.<br>Among the tasks, you will have<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Eliminate a given number of enemies and turrets<br></li><li>Cut the enemy supplies by destroying them before they fall down to the ground<br></li><li>Survive for a given time<br></li><li>Support your ally for a given time<br></li><li>Destroy the most important building of the enemy<br></li><li>Fight with the boss's huge airship</li></ul><br>For the whole game, you will shoot hundreds of enemy warplanes, turrets, and parachutes.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 exciting missions<br></li><li>8 kinds of weapons and upgrades (guns, rockets, bombs, air-air, and air-ground weapons)<br></li><li>8 different enemy aircraft and turrets<br></li><li>Various environments on 5 maps<br></li><li>Destructible buildings<br></li><li>Full 3D VR simulation of the flight</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/4bedcb2c1a91ad2e5e4e23c556574514.poster.avif?t=1747085888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/4bedcb2c1a91ad2e5e4e23c556574514.webm?t=1747085888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199980/extras/4bedcb2c1a91ad2e5e4e23c556574514.mp4?t=1747085888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Good luck soldier!",
